  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "IDFC FIRST WOW! Black is a secured card with up to 16.7% value-back on travel spends. This card primarily caters to frequent travellers with accelerated rewards on travel spends, complimentary lounge access & zero forex markup fee. The card offers 50 bonus points for every Rs. 150 spent on hotels & 30 bonus points for every Rs. 150 spent on flight bookings through IDFC FIRST’s mobile app. Cardholders can redeem the accumulated reward points at a value of 1 RP = Rs. 0.50 against travel bookings and save significantly on their travel spends. Besides travel, this credit card also offers accelerated reward points on other online & offline spends, along with a base reward rate on often-excluded categories, such as insurance and utility bills. Another thing that makes this card stand out is the joining benefits. At a joining fee of Rs. 750, this card offers joining benefits worth more than Rs. 5,000 through complimentary memberships, bonus cashback, and discounts on travel bookings.",
